+\phasetag{TPS + DOK-3 driver}
+\frameworkphaseheader{Explore}{2--3}{33}{%
+\phaseitems{
+  \item 5 laps across 33 min.
+  \item Lap 1 (5 min): Try-It 3 — ice cube. Press pairs to identify \(k =\) Temp \(\times\) Time.
